.TH ZEX-DEPENDS 1 "2026-06-27" "zex 5.0.0" "Zainium OS"
.SH NAME
zex-depends \- show package dependency tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zex depends
.RI [ \-\-depth
.IR N ]
.I <package>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zex depends
displays the full dependency tree for
.IR <package> ,
including transitive dependencies.
.PP
Each dependency is shown with its tier origin and installed/available status.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-depth INR
Limit tree depth (default: unlimited).
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
    zex depends curl
    zex depends python3 --depth 2
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zex (1),
.BR zex-why (1),
.BR zex-install (1)
